The four files under frames/ composite their main media from ffmpeg's synthetic testsrc2
filter, not from the channel's photography -- but they also draw
fixtures/en-halloween-decorating/brand/logo-en.png and the channel handle, which this
prototype's scene files name by path. That logo is "all rights reserved", and a render
containing it is a derivative of it, so these four carry the same terms:

    Copyright (c) 2026 Mohammad Bagher Ehtemam. All rights reserved. Permission is
    granted to use these files ONLY to build, test, benchmark and study this repository.
    Any other use requires the copyright holder's written permission.

The scene files, the generator scripts, README.md and FINDINGS.md are MIT with the rest
of the repository (../../../../LICENSE). The canonical list of every carved-out path in
the tree is ../../../../LICENSE-MEDIA.md.
